USAGE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  df -h                     Filesystem usage
  du -sh <dir>              Directory size
  du -sh *                  Current directory sizes


LARGE FILES
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  du -ah . | sort -h        Sort files by size
  find . -type f -size +1G  Files larger than 1 GB


NVME / SSD
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  lsblk                     Show drives
  lsblk -d                  Show physical disks
  smartctl -a /dev/nvme0    SMART information


MOUNT INFORMATION
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  findmnt                   Show mount tree
  lsblk -f                  Filesystem + UUID information
